The Vulnerability
The secret is hardcoded but encoded. You must reverse the encoding chain to find the original secret.
The Encoding Chain (Forward)
plain
secret → base64_encode → strrev (reverse) → bin2hex
Reverse the Chain
plain
hex → hex2bin → strrev → base64_decode = SECRET
